Following the removal of old RTC driver for OMAP, this updates the
defconfig files for boards that use the RTC. Note that userspace that
made use of the old /dev or /proc interface still needs to be changed
to use generic RTC api.

The configurations have been solely build-tested. For the perseus2
defconfig I had to disable the LCD because of dependency on the now
absent OMAP microwire driver.

Signed-off-by: Andrzej Zaborowski <balrog@zabor.org>

